      "rationale": "Override of the automatic rule. Grounding scored 'pass' only because 'REAL-MM-RAG' appears in the appended Sources block; the answer body names the benchmark 'ViDoRe' (a different benchmark listed in REAL-MM-RAG's related-work table), which is factually wrong."
